Clearing `HCI_UART_PROTO_INIT` under the write lock of `proto_lock` ensures that no new readers can enter the protocol receive path (via the lock), and that any ongoing readers have completed. This prevents the receive handler from accessing freed resources after the protocol is closed and `hu->hdev` is set to NULL.

